+# TLS Backend Policy
+
+Nothing is currently recorded in this project regarding a TLS backend decision. The codebase exposes TLS support only through `Engine.RunTLS`, a thin wrapper around Go's standard-library `net/http`/`crypto/tls` (`server.ListenAndServeTLS`), and documents optional use of the external `gin-gonic/autotls` package for Let's Encrypt certificate management; neither of these constitutes a recorded project policy choosing or mandating a specific TLS backend.
